WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.830
Trace this example route. Both flags are on the straight path to the chest.

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:12.819
The starter code moves twice. Add one more Move to reach the chest after crossing both flags.

00:00:12.819 --> 00:00:15.603
Add Collect at the end of the route.

00:00:15.603 --> 00:00:22.446
Test it. Watch each flag change as the pirate visits it, then watch the pirate collect.
